# 🚨 STARTUP-SAFE CHECKLIST FOR JUNIOR / REMOTE DEVELOPERS

### **1️⃣ Offer & Agreement**

* [ ] Get a **written Offer Letter / Employment Agreement**
* [ ] Confirm **job title and role**
* [ ] Confirm **salary / monthly CTC / pay cycle**
* [ ] Check **probation period** and **salary during probation**
* [ ] Ensure **notice period** is defined for leaving the company

**Red flag:** “We’ll give documents later” → walk away

---

### **2️⃣ Work Scope & Project Clarity**

* [ ] Ask for **Statement of Work (SOW) / Product Requirement Document (PRD) / BDD**
* [ ] Confirm **features and tasks are documented**
* [ ] Confirm **acceptance criteria** (“what counts as done”)
* [ ] Confirm **change request process** (any new task = new agreement or extra pay)

**Red flag:** “Tasks will be explained verbally / requirements keep changing” → walk away

---

### **3️⃣ Hours & Leave**

* [ ] Confirm **working hours** (e.g., 9–5 or 9–6)
* [ ] Confirm **weekly off** (Sat/Sun)
* [ ] Check **overtime policy / compensation**
* [ ] Check **leave policy** (paid sick leave, casual leave, etc.)

**Red flag:** “We work whenever needed, no documentation” → walk away

---

### **4️⃣ Salary & Payments**

* [ ] Payment in **bank transfer only** (never cash only)
* [ ] Confirm **salary breakup** (basic + allowances)
* [ ] Confirm **pay date** (monthly, fixed)
* [ ] Any bonus or incentives should be **in writing**

**Red flag:** “Salary will be decided later / trust-based pay” → walk away

---

### **5️⃣ Intellectual Property & Confidentiality**

* [ ] NDA / Confidentiality Agreement (if working on company code/project)
* [ ] IP Assignment Agreement (clearly defines who owns code/work)
* [ ] Confirm **you keep portfolio rights if allowed**

**Red flag:** “Everything belongs to us, even unpaid work / no documents” → walk away

---

### **6️⃣ Health & Safety / Workplace Behavior**

* [ ] Confirm **health & safety policies** (especially for office work)
* [ ] Check **harassment / grievance policy**
* [ ] Confirm **online/remote reporting channels** if team spreads rumors or blame

**Red flag:** “We don’t have HR / just manage yourself” → walk away

---

### **7️⃣ Exit Policy**

* [ ] Confirm **final settlement rules**
* [ ] Confirm **how notice period works**
* [ ] Confirm **any deductions / claims at exit**

**Red flag:** “Exit policy will be decided later” → walk away

---

### **8️⃣ Company Red Flags Checklist**

* [ ] Avoid companies that **refuse documents**
* [ ] Avoid companies that **promise future benefits but no current clarity**
* [ ] Avoid companies that **push unpaid overtime**
* [ ] Avoid companies with **toxic team behavior**
* [ ] Avoid companies where **projects have no clear scope or plan**

---

### ✅ Quick “10-Second Test” Before Joining

Ask these **3 questions**:

1. “Can I get the Offer Letter and salary details in writing before joining?”
2. “Is there a clear scope or PRD/BDD for my work?”
3. “Are my work hours, leaves, and exit policy documented?”

* If **any answer is vague** → do **not join**

